directory privacy (restrict access to site) nginx
1. apt-get install apache2-utils
2. create user with sudo htpasswd -c /etc/nginx/.htpasswd user
3. nano /etc/nginx/sites-available/
4. add code in .conf

  location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
        auth_basic "Restricted Content";
        auth_basic_user_file /etc/nginx/.htpasswd;
    }

check conf file and site.

