AWS-CLI
1. check status of using AWS-ID:
aws sts get-caller-identity

2. list S3 bucket
   aws s3 ls
*  Create a new bucket:
   aws s3 mb s3://your-bucket-name
** Upload a file to S3:
   aws s3 cp yourfile.txt s3://your-bucket-name/
*** Delete bucket
    aws s3 rb s3://your-bucket-name --force

3. Launch AWS instance
Create: aws ec2 run-instances --image-id ami-0e35ddab05955cf57 --count 1 --instance-type t2.micro --key-name rajputkey --security-groups default
List: aws ec2 describe-instances --query "Reservations[*].Instances[*].[InstanceId,State.Name,Tags[*].Value]" --output table
Delete: aws ec2 terminate-instances --instance-ids i-0abcdef1234567890

4. aws iam create-user --user-name newuser
